The  guest  service  module for PAM allows guest logins.  If suc‐
cessful, the module sets the PAM environment variable to the  lo‐
gin  name.  The application can check this variable using to dif‐
ferentiate guest logins from normal logins.   The  following  op‐
tions  may be passed to the module: Comma‐separated list of guest
account names.  The default is A typical value for would be Omits
the password prompt if the target account is on the list of guest
accounts.  The password typed in by the user is exported  as  the
item.  This is useful for applications like where guest users are
encouraged  to use their email address as password.  Requires the
guest user to type in the guest account name  as  password.   The
